      "id": "full_story_part1_c2",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        0
      ],
      "text": "the woodcutter said.",
      "text_sha256": "8ed92eed78263196a2f5744da604acb33f62a7cff3d9334ef3bffb57c39fbba2",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c3",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "woodcutter",
      "speaker": "woodcutter",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:woodcutter",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        0
      ],
      "text": "\"He lay near the mountain road, stabbed once in the chest. The blood was already dry when I saw him. Broken bamboo and marks on the ground showed a fight. I found no sword or bow, only rope and a comb.\"",
      "text_sha256": "4611c434bb6937b26d592327d4d0ec35d0a9c44b8596ad1c8dcb1efaab3e927b",
      "word_count": 41,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c4",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "monk",
      "speaker": "monk",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:monk",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "\"I saw the couple yesterday at noon,\"",
      "text_sha256": "964b11ed0837e8641595dd708f3a1bf2ed22c0df657896d30d3e71fcb991a3cf",
      "word_count": 7,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c5",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "the traveling monk said.",
      "text_sha256": "18a9bac7f7c92af2fff36e01649a2de9189cfd12610372f5629dbac5c6d55092",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c6",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "monk",
      "speaker": "monk",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:monk",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "\"He carried a sword and bow, and his wife rode beside him.\"",
      "text_sha256": "b0a755a1b6302af1c6ef8bd0a3feb1b1255c1651f4c755f48472013dbac8d4be",
      "word_count": 12,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c6.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c7",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "constable",
      "speaker": "constable",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:constable",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "text": "\"I caught the famous bandit Tajomaru near the bridge,\"",
      "text_sha256": "e9ee77c696ba57251152bb347443aa357311bb0e99750b6a977fa26ce3d8cb21",
      "word_count": 9,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c7.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c8",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "text": "the constable said.",
      "text_sha256": "efe818a3cefc925066630245a2de004403f82c84348b41567e6d085aaea82bb5",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c8.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c9",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "constable",
      "speaker": "constable",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:constable",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "text": "\"He had fallen off a horse, but still had Takehiro's bow. Find the wife and ask her what he did.\"",
      "text_sha256": "906f7944056d25314499e5b4c03a7b8726e650c0d918b8ede3ec00c05af8598e",
      "word_count": 20,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c9.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c10",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "old_woman",
      "speaker": "old_woman",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:old_woman",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "\"Takehiro, a kind samurai, married my daughter Masago,\"",
      "text_sha256": "42fad97c9c4dc53ab12b5be7348d46cb025082b667f8f42620294c53f2ea0f6b",
      "word_count": 8,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c10.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c11",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "the old woman said.",
      "text_sha256": "7d08b066a9a18c0974874f621f2f8fc88e9fc9409d9e513c46ce5668b2fe88ec",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c11.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c12",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "old_woman",
      "speaker": "old_woman",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:old_woman",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "\"She is proud and only nineteen. Please find her before you send me home without news.\"",
      "text_sha256": "e2fb98a2f1ad1485aa3e66768dec828ab2dbd5bc33e2a74bfa8323d401df7bb7",
      "word_count": 16,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part1_c12.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c1",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "tajomaru",
      "speaker": "tajomaru",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:tajomaru",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "text": "\"I killed him fairly,\"",
      "text_sha256": "0e4ab3c0800680088600a01d37a7c034ddb6a51b856ed45084716e7b42bd1418",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c2",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "text": "Tajomaru said. \"The wind lifted her face covering, and I wanted her. I promised him buried treasure and led him into the bushes. There I tied him to a cedar tree. She fought with her dagger.",
      "text_sha256": "018e048dc2dc0ec0c9419946620241dd76c4b63ab3e2c172d3bdeab29c2eca41",
      "word_count": 36,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c3",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "tajomaru",
      "speaker": "tajomaru",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:tajomaru",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "text": "\"She held my arm and begged for one of us to die. She would leave with the man who lived. I freed him for a fair sword fight. Twenty-three blows—no other man had lasted twenty! She was gone when he fell. I took his weapons and left.\"",
      "text_sha256": "51891bb7a83ba94e093be6ccb37d80afb37d93d50eb1eb22a09c6ab546a00fbc",
      "word_count": 47,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c4",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "masago",
      "speaker": "masago",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:masago",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "text": "\"I crawled towards my husband,\"",
      "text_sha256": "b14fd5c5629f3a4ce68a9da8e2fc8c1a6b85247794df343184e5c182b8dac9dc",
      "word_count": 5,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c5",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        6,
        7
      ],
      "text": "Masago said at the temple. \"The bandit had left him tied up. I begged him to die with me. His cold eyes said I was nothing, even though I was his wife. \"He moved his lips while I held my dagger. 'Kill me,' he said, so I stabbed him. I could not stand those eyes.",
      "text_sha256": "1f7df60899cab5074947c799e4bbbe898755452a1aa2457e375fb38c1f2e9f3e",
      "word_count": 55,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c6",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "masago",
      "speaker": "masago",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:masago",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "text": "\"I later tried drowning myself, but I failed. Where can I go after that?\"",
      "text_sha256": "40ccdb365eb14206374cf4c6468d230c2b6a4b476566f89cf84ac16b055f6726",
      "word_count": 14,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part2_c6.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c1",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "takehiro",
      "speaker": "takehiro",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:takehiro",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "\"I heard him speaking kindly to her,\"",
      "text_sha256": "554d89ee2f0e593b46fd78c49094fc3e5c716ecea96401f0b3b83e30dfdf75fe",
      "word_count": 7,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c2",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9,
        10,
        11,
        12
      ],
      "text": "Takehiro's spirit said through a medium. \"She asked him to take her anywhere. Then she pointed at me: 'Kill that man.' \"He pushed her away and asked if she should live or die. I nearly forgave him then, but she ran away. He cut one rope and left me. \"I got up beside the cedar and picked up her small dagger. She had dropped it there. I pushed it into my own chest. \"The bushes around me grew quiet. Someone came slowly towards me on silent feet. A hand I could not see quietly pulled the dagger from my chest.",
      "text_sha256": "269217cbfb719aae12f9d0f7c272515c9874adc10b9b48b808fbfb49d6a01279",
      "word_count": 100,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c3",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "takehiro",
      "speaker": "takehiro",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:takehiro",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "text": "\"I sank into the darkness and never came back.\"",
      "text_sha256": "2714380487c9a889711947e3053b7b1b6c71edf61a311d3609149ea0210f226d",
      "word_count": 9,
      "split_reason": "article_end(直前の分割点から続く同一Voice区間)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/in_a_grove/run_sf_prod_01/a2/narration/full_story_part3_c3.wav"
    }
